"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4436830","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4174620-1847286114029935","game_id":"steam-4174620","kind":"announcement","title":"🌎🎮 Market Moe is Featured in ZNT Horizon 2026!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45857294/d76e2e27145ccd1d359a7cfe7f7bb260c2bf87a9.png Today, ZNT Horizon celebrates indie games from Latin America and Southeast Asia, featuring over 100 games from 14 different countries! We’re excited to be part of this showcase organized by ZNT Productions, which is also celebrating its 10th anniversary! 🎉 👻 Market Moe launches on November 11, 2026! Want to experience the horror before launch? A free demo is available now on Steam! Step into a Japanese convenience store, wo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:21:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029935","verified_at":"2026-10-21T22:41:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4174620-1846651706691628","game_id":"steam-4174620","kind":"announcement","title":"🎮👻 Market Moe is part of Steam Next Fest: October 2026!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45857294/1df9b615b761d0e385cea4cb010b0761f279fa26.png Steam Next Fest is here! From October 19–26, discover hundreds of upcoming games and try their free demos on Steam. We’re excited to have Market Moe featured in this edition! 🛒🌙 Step into a Japanese convenience store and take on the night shift… but be careful. Something is not quite right. 🎮 Play the free demo now! 🗓️ Full Release: November 11, 2026 If you enjoy psychological horror, eerie atmospheres, and Japanese-inspire","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:11:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691628","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4174620-1846018067941814","game_id":"steam-4174620","kind":"announcement","title":"👻Market Moe is Featured in Ghost Story Celebration on Steam!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45857294/e5d63f722e08dcea722f0c5f499d1b466e1670b7.png We’re excited to announce that Market Moe will be part of the upcoming Ghost Story Celebration, running from October 12–19, 2026 on Steam! Get ready for a haunting experience filled with unsettling mysteries, eerie encounters, and things that go bump in the night. If you enjoy ghost stories and psychological horror, keep an eye out for Market Moe during the event! Step into the eerie atmosphere of a Japanese convenience sto","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T17:28:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941814","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4174620-1843481262690547","game_id":"steam-4174620","kind":"announcement","title":"Market Moe – Release Announcement","summary":"The wait is almost over. Market Moe will officially launch on November 11! Step into a night-shift nightmare where the ordinary routine of a local Japanese convenience store shifts into something deep, dark, and psychological. What to Expect Atmospheric Psychological Horror: Experience the quiet, unsettling tension of an late-night Japanese environment. Immersive Simulation Mechanics: Handle store tasks while trying to decipher the mysteries lurking just outside the neon light. Retro J-Horror Ae","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T22:43:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690547","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4174620-1840944183777228","game_id":"steam-4174620","kind":"announcement","title":"The Trailer of Market Moe is here","summary":"🌙 A New Trailer for Market Moe is Here! The night shift begins. In Market Moe, your job seems simple: restock the shelves, keep the stores running, and make it through the night. But something is wrong. Strange events begin to unfold, reality starts to distort, and somewhere in the darkness... the woman in the black dress is coming for you. 🎬 Watch the new trailer and take a glimpse into the nightmare waiting for you. If you enjoy psychological horror, unsettling atmospheres, and stories that ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T16:01:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183777228","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4174620-1836506165584091","game_id":"steam-4174620","kind":"announcement","title":"Market Moe Prologue is Available Now!","summary":"Hello everyone! The wait is over—the Market Moe Prologue demo is now available! This is your first chance to step into the mysterious world of Market Moe and experience the beginning of the story. Explore, uncover the secrets hidden within the supermarket, and prepare for what's to come. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45857294/617668d740b2d21618f470900971913d8baf5b6a.jpg Your feedback is incredibly valuable at this stage of development. If you encounter any bugs or have suggestions, please let me know in th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T17:10:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165584091","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4174620-1836506165573357","game_id":"steam-4174620","kind":"update","title":"Demo Release Update","summary":"We have decided to postpone the release of our demo to better prepare for an upcoming showcase. This additional time will allow us to polish the experience and present the demo in the best possible way. Thank you for your patience and for supporting the project by wishlisting the game. We can't wait to share the demo with you and will announce the new release date as soon as it's confirmed. Thank you for your continued support!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-05T01:22:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165573357","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4174620-1835236783562805","game_id":"steam-4174620","kind":"announcement","title":"Market Moe Prologue Launch Date Announced!","summary":"After months of development, I'm excited to announce that the Market Moe Prologue will be available on July 17th, 2026. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45857294/512fdef422d43269e283c687f5f65354e8493625.jpg Take on a late-night shift at a small Japanese convenience store where things slowly begin to feel... wrong. Strange occurrences, increasingly disturbing atmosphere will turn an ordinary night into a psychological horror experience. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45857294/617668d740b2d21618f470900971913d8baf5b6a.jpg 👻","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T09:26:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783562805","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4174620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:14Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-